<h2>Healthy Food Groups</h2>

<p>🥦 Vegetables - Rich in vitamins and minerals.</p>

<p>🍎 Fruits - Give us vitamins and fiber.</p>

<p>🍗 Protein - Helps build and repair muscles.</p>

<p>🍚 Whole Grains - Give our body energy.</p>

<p>🥛 Milk and Dairy - Keep our bones strong.</p>

