<h2>Nutrition Facts</h2>

<p>💧 Drink at least 8 glasses of water every day.</p>

<p>🍭 Too much sugar can increase the risk of diseases.</p>

<p>🥗 Eating different kinds of food helps your body stay healthy.</p>

<p>🏃 Exercise regularly to keep your body fit and strong.</p>

<p>😴 Getting enough sleep is also important for good health.</p>

